GIVEN `the day the insurer received the notice`                            IS A DATE
      `an insured event had made the insurer liable before the contract ended` IS A BOOLEAN
      c                                                                     IS A `A contract of compulsory motor insurance`
GIVETH AN EITHER `A problem with the facts` NUMBER
`Decree 03/2021 Article 11(1)(b) — the refund before the reasonable costs, on a notice received on` `the day the insurer received the notice` `where an insured event had made the insurer liable` `an insured event had made the insurer liable before the contract ended` `under` c MEANS
    IF   `an insured event had made the insurer liable before the contract ended`
    THEN RIGHT 0
    ELSE IF       `the day the insurer received the notice` LESS THAN c's `insurance begins on`
              OR  `the day the insurer received the notice` GREATER THAN c's `insurance ends on`
         THEN LEFT `the day of revocation is outside the term of the insurance`
         ELSE RIGHT (c's `the premium paid`
                     TIMES (Day (c's `insurance ends on`) MINUS Day `the day the insurer received the notice`)
                     DIVIDED BY (Day (c's `insurance ends on`) MINUS Day (c's `insurance begins on`)))

